        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. The pay rate of new hires and transfers into the Service Consumption Technician classification is as outlined in paragraph (D) of this Letter of Agreement. If an employee in the Service Consumption Technician classification fails to maintain the route quota average as established by the Company (see Attachment \"A\") for eight (8) months in any twelve (12) month period and the employee has not completed 45 months of employment, he or she will be paid no more than 80% of their classified rate. Employees who have completed 45 months of employment will be paid 80% of their classified rate.",
